## Context

_What's the situation? What forces are at play (technical, business, organizational)? Two paragraphs max. Link to deeper docs rather than re-stating._

## Decision

_The decision, in one or two sentences. Active voice. "We will use X." Not "We're considering X."_

## Consequences

**Positive:**
- _What gets better as a result of this decision._

**Negative:**
- _What gets worse, or what new problems we accept._

**Neutral:**
- _Things that change but aren't clearly better or worse._

## Alternatives considered

_For an ADR, brief is fine — 1-2 sentences per alternative._

- **Status quo:** _what happens if we don't decide. Why we reject it._
- **Alternative B:** _what + why we reject it._
- **Alternative C:** _what + why we reject it._

